{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>And the Mitzpah, which he said, etc.</b> And the Mitzpah which is in Mount Gilead, as it is written ״וַיַּעֲבֹר אֶת מִצְפֵה גִלְעָד״ (Judges 11). And why is its name called Mitzpah? Because one of them said to the other: May YHWH watch between me and you if you violate the covenant." "<b>For we were hidden.</b> And no man could see his fellow."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:36.512454915Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}